+### Troubleshooting
+1. xdg-desktop-menu is missing: Create an empty executable named 'xdg-deskop-menu':
+```
+#!/bin/bash
+exit 0
+```
+Make it executable and move it to /usr/local/bin:
+```shell
+chmod 744 xdg-desktop-menu
+sudo mv xdg-desktop-menu /usr/local/bin
+```
+
+2. VoipStream feature is causing trouble: In the 'inet' folder, disable the feature via
+```shell
+opp_featuretool disable VoipStream
+```
+To check if it is enabled, you can run the following command:
+```shell
+opp_featuretool -q isenabled VoipStream && echo enabled
+```
+
+3. Z3 feature is causing trouble: In the 'inet' folder, disable the feature via
+```shell
+opp_featuretool disable Z3GateSchedulingConfigurator
+```
+
 ### Deterministic6G installation
 1. Make sure this project is in your workspace (see [Workspace Setup](#workspace-setup)).
 2. Build the Deterministic6G framework:
